  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OECD MENA Investment, 2011-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OECD MENA Investment, 2012-2016 - OECD MENA Investment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet inr&#xe4;ttades som en regional satsning, initierades och leds  av ekonomierna i MENA-regionen. Fr&#xe4;mjande av breda reformer f&#xf6;r att   f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra investeringsklimatet, modernisera f&#xf6;retagsklimatet, st&#xe4;rka  regionala och internationella partnerskap, i syfte att fr&#xe4;mja         regional integration, ekonomiskt dev. och jobb skapande (Investering  f&#xf6;r jobb, fr&#xe4;mja aff&#xe4;rer, fr&#xe4;mja kvinnor i ekonomi)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme was established as a regional effort, initiated and led by economies in the MENA region. It promotes broad reforms to enhance the investment climate, modernise the business environment,           strengthen regional and international partnerships, with a view of    promoting regional integration, economic dev. and job creation        (Investment for jobs, Promoting business, Fostering women in economy)</narrative>
  </description>
